sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant API as Fastify API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant WS as Hocuspocus WS Gateway

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login (email, password)
    API->>DB: Query user by email
    DB-->>API: Return user record + Argon2id hash
    API->>API: Verify password in constant time
    API-->>User: Set-Cookie: __Host-refresh_token (HttpOnly, Secure)<br/>Body: { accessToken: "JWT..." }

    Note over User,WS: Realtime Session Ticket Handshake
    User->>API: POST /api/v1/boards/:id/live-ticket (Bearer JWT)
    API->>DB: Check workspace & board membership (RBAC)
    DB-->>API: User is EDITOR
    API-->>User: Return single-use Ticket (HMAC-SHA256, TTL 60s)

    User->>WS: Connect: wss://realtime.../boards/:id?ticket=xyz
    WS->>WS: Verify Ticket signature & boardId match
    WS-->>User: HTTP 101 Switching Protocols
    Note over User,WS: WebSocket Session Authenticated as EDITOR
